The ccimgd daemon and ccimg client vendored under scripts/ are derived from
claude-ssh-image-skill by Alexander Zeitler (https://github.com/AlexZeitler/claude-ssh-image-skill),
used and redistributed under the MIT License below. The build.sh adds a
linux/arm64 target, and the go.mod `go` directive is lowered to 1.21 so the
binaries build on stock Go without fetching a newer toolchain; the Go source
code is otherwise unmodified.

